      "principle": "Bigamy is strictly prohibited by the Christian religious law.",
      "held": "Since bigamy is strictly prohibited by the Christian religious law and the Act also impliedly prohibits it, applicability of the said IPC provisions to married Christians may be seen as a foregone conclusion.",
